Lightning emanates from you in a circular wave with radius [2, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)], doing [40, 54, 65, 74, 82 (TL1-5; SP 100)] to [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; SP 100)] lightning damage ([81, 109, 130, 149, 165 (TL1-5; SP 100)] average) and possibly dazing anyone affected (75% chance).

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
